{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JvXXsR98_anLiEn3ltBwMQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:38.006138+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JvXXsR98_anLiEn3ltBwMQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/SvwjWQFbZvTvWFuAeubDnGuDBlMfAvCkciaYwYb0rnfJPvfpfTE8BnsVrsAEyicdsYF1UOdzYeVWese1AyetBmKzdmiaOjx8kT6ibtzrvVIdWjA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>石油化工科学研究院</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2027年推荐免试研究生招生工作办法</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>中国石油化工股份有限公司石油化工科学研究院（简称石科院，院校代码86301）热忱欢迎全国高校优秀应届本科毕业生申请我院推荐免试研究生。我院遵循公平公正、全面衡量、保证质量、择优录取的接收推免生工作原则，化学工程、化学工艺、应用化学、工业催化、材料与化工等专业均可接收推免生。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/SvwjWQFbZvQlYEW9biaSMicMfevvosc9zmYjpKIDHFSfbsv2HN8XaewBW6Vw4MJYkwIvoQuCBV27KgkXib2szUIFLd7Tyo9qLBwiaMputPXFIKM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>院校简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.1</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>石油化工科学研究院（简称石科院）创建于1956年7月，是中国石化直属科研机构。院本部位于海淀区学院路，在昌平高新科技园区和天津南港工业区设有研究机构和科学试验基地。科研领域包括：炼油、石油产品、化工、材料、新能源、环保、智能化、资源循环利用、双碳、装备仪器等。</span></p><p><span>石科院是1981年国家首批博士硕士学位授予单位，目前设有材料与化工、化学工艺、应用化学博士点，材料与化工、化学工程、化学工艺、应用化学、工业催化硕士点，在读研究生330余名。面向未来，石科院将努力打造世界一流的绿色低碳能源化工科学研究院，为中国石化打造世界领先洁净能源化工公司提供全方位技术支撑。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>推免生招生专业目录</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.2</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/SvwjWQFbZvRxE8Oe83KMLiby9RfudCcjBt2TSmtAOz3KsolicOuuZyLEicUEJvviaYsHFA0VUUibYMtnaxicsF475yGXALpuAhSO9aq6eX7hz0Glo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.3</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1．思想品德好，身体健康，学习刻苦，有较强的学习能力和科研创新潜力，愿为能源化工行业科技发展和社会主义现代化建设服务的应届高校毕业生。</span></p><p><span>2．能够获得所在高校推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span>3．本科专业与申请专业相同相近，或本科专业为数学、物理、化学等基础学科，对石油化工、材料化学、能源化工、环境、碳中和相关专业有持续兴趣，能够胜任研究生阶段专业学习。</span></p><p><span>4．本科期间学习成绩优秀，专业成绩和综合排名在本专业名列前茅（本科阶段有论文公开发表、或有科研成果、或在全国重大竞赛中获奖的，将予以优先考虑）。</span></p><p><span>5．大学期间未受过任何处分。</span></p><p><span>6．具有较强的英语听、说、读、写能力。</span></p><p><span>7．须在毕业时获得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书，未获得者将取消其录取资格。</span></p><p><span>8．身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.4</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1． 石科院接收推荐免试研究生（含直博）申请表（见申请材料附件表1）。</span></p><p><span>2．专家推荐信（相关领域，副教授及以上职称）1份（见申请材料附件表2）。</span></p><p><span>3．加盖教务公章的本科成绩单原件。</span></p><p><span>4．英语等级证书复印件。</span></p><p><span>5．各类获奖证书复印件（自愿提供）。</span></p><p><span>6．发表的学术论文复印件（自愿提供）。</span></p><p><span>7．申请者认为有必要提交的可以证明自己综合素质的其他材料（自愿提供）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SvwjWQFbZvRAev78RpNibaozyT69JjJPZTicPWHX4kngV9Y3sNCDl3PLM2ak6XNpGjw4txcLKiaC4PTIRCE7fppCdu2xXecvV2rF5wddibf8IOs/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>扫码下载</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/SvwjWQFbZvRabALo65uoicLUY9FKQbmicwpDay3lrxApKu2eYnDVBgE2x9y1icRpx50gJGlozwPz97ISntHXdfHyk7pBuxvywqsQpBPZgYJ1XU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>请于</span><span><strong><span>2026年10月12日12:00前</span></strong></span><span>将第1、3、4项材料的原件按顺序合并扫描为一个清晰的PDF文件发送至邮箱zhangxm.ripp@sinopec.com，文件名和邮件的主题名为“推免+本科院校+本科专业+姓名+CET4/6成绩”，例如：推免中国石油大学（北京）化学工程专业王冕六级426。</span><strong><span><span>邮件发送后，请电话确认010-82368155。</span></span></strong><span>来院面试时，将第1-7项纸质材料提交我院研招办审核人员。</span></p><p><span>请同学们务必确保所提交材料清晰（尤其是成绩单），以免影响面试。凡提供虚假材料，一经发现，取消复试资格、录取资格、入学资格或学籍。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请及接收程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.5</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>推免生资格审核确认、报考、录取以及备案公开等相关工作均通过教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm（简称推免服务系统)进行。</span></p><p><span>1．申请者在推免服务系统填写申请信息。</span></p><p><span>2．我院研招办对申请者提供的材料进行审核后，组织对初审合格的申请者进行面试考核。通过考核的申请者确定为拟录取考生。思想政治素质和品德考核合格、体检合格后，办理录取手续。</span></p><p><span>3．按教育部规定，已被接收的推荐免试生不得再参加统考。获准接收的推免生如同时报考统考生（以现场确认的信息为准），则视为自愿选择参加全国硕士统考，取消其推荐免试资格。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>面试考核内容及方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.6</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>面试考核内容包括英语听说、专业知识和综合能力与实践，主要考核方式为“考官问、考生答”。</span></p><p><span>1.</span><strong><span>英语听说</span></strong><span>。英语听力测试主要测试考生的听音辨义、理解日常交谈内容和一般题材讲座等能力。英语口语主要测试考生运用外语知识与技能进行一般口头交流的能力。面试组成员用英语提问考生3-5个问题，考生用英语与考核组进行交流，考试时间为5－10分钟。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><strong><span>专业知识</span></strong><span>。采用综合性、开放性试题，内容包括有机化学、化工原理、分析化学以及考生大学期间学习的有关课程。面试组成员随机出题，考生回答。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><strong><span>综合能力与实践</span></strong><span>。主要考察考生的基础理论、实验技能、综合运用能力和创新能力等，并对考生思想政治素质和道德品质、对我院创新文化理解认同、大学阶段学习成绩、科研活动、社会实践、心理素质等进行考察。</span></p><p><span>面试组成员“背靠背”对考生当场进行成绩评定，取所有成员打分的平均值作为考生最终的考试成绩。原始打分表、复试记录、是否录取意见等由研招办保留，任何人不得改动。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学制、奖励、待遇</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.7</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>推荐免试硕士研究生基本学制为3年，直博生基本学制为5年。学习方式为全日制。</span></p><p><span>推免生被录取为我院直博生，</span><strong><span>奖励二万元</span></strong><span>；录取为硕士研究生，</span><strong><span>奖励一万元</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>我院奖助体系完备，不收取学费和住宿费。研究生在读期间享受优厚助学金待遇，优秀在校生可申请优秀学生干部、优秀研究生、优秀毕业生以及学术成果奖励等多项奖学金。研究生主要在北京学院路院区和昌平科研基地完成学习和论文工作。研究生宿舍为2-3人间，实行申请住宿制。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>录取信息公示与公开</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.8</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>拟录取名单在本单位网站http://ripp.sinopec.com/ripp/  公示，公示时间不少于 7 日，公示期间不得修改公示内容，如需变动，将另行公示 7 日，并对变动内容做出说明。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>入学复查</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.9</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>新生报到后，对其进行思想政治素质、道德品质、专业素质、健康状况等复查。如发现下列问题，取消入学资格。</span></p><p><span>1．申请人未能完成本科培养方案规定的所有课程及实践环节（含毕业论文和实习）的学分要求；</span></p><p><span>2．申请人的毕业论文和实习成绩未达到“良好”以上；</span></p><p><span>3．申请人获得录取资格后课程学习有不及格科目；</span></p><p><span>4．申请人在获得录取资格后、毕业前受到过纪律处分；</span></p><p><span>5．申请人毕业时未能获得本科毕业证书和学位证书；</span></p><p><span>6．申请人的申请材料存在伪造现象或者故意隐瞒了有可能影响其录取的重要信息；</span></p><p><span>7．申请人患有严重生理或精神疾病、不能坚持学习，或患有严重传染性疾病有可能影响到他人健康；</span></p><p><span>录取资格复查工作将在每年新生入学报到后的第一个月内进行。通过录取资格复查的申请人即获得正式学籍。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究生招生办公室联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.10</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系人: 张老师</span></p><p><span>电子邮件：zhangxm.ripp@sinopec.com</span></p><p><span>电话：010-82368155</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SvwjWQFbZvSK9GdkvKoqgAaca7SibDTKBw67zKKDIOiaMXaENJZvticWHQPygZXpDk3HVYq5a8f086bg7GSwgNicruicXB2Y0OWwY56l0mnvfNJ0/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>石科院新媒体工作室</span></p><p><span>供稿：张孝铭</span></p><p><span>编辑、制作：翟菲莹</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SvwjWQFbZvTZibIReA80Fz5EZ5YhfCicViaRJemGIEuicPaicyN05hc8AaLuEaV7dGSCLmGROpwDheBIQXFntag9Q8SpQ7ldF5tqFFibtUKwUzfr8/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/SvwjWQFbZvTZegadVs9sxSewssFyMsC3cy9icm1oGyiaa4hllFHYqDwODT9NMJP2q1JwnglZ7jVXBePyTDzoGWZzgVWib4xNdpnBC8kic8BJ15g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"0d0c65329fb11e1a4beeb34d34f27f7530b1b3c6c3e87a20048ddd771be45464","textLength":2724,"sourceSha256":"9f66325c4263ca81960c83ad3957f3821890af3bc6e4f396ccd0ef71934d4aa7","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e38baf59f8651d02735f","title":"2026年中国石油化工股份有限公司石油化工科学研究院2027年推荐免试研究生招生工作办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:38.006138+00:00"}
